WARGAMES: SCREENS REVISITED
--------------------------
A browser demo by Squeepty

An audiovisual homage to the terminal
screens, modem culture, vector graphics
and Cold War tension of WarGames (1983).

Music: "Eclipse"
by Matthew "4mat" Simmonds

HTML5 Canvas / TypeScript / Web Audio
Released: June 2026

Click or press a key to start.
Enable audio and watch from the beginning.

Independent, non-commercial fan homage.
